00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.080
Pasteur !

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.280
Pasteur !

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.120
On va faire trembler l'univers.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.000
